    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to bring to the market this stunning three bedroom semi-detached property situated in a hugely popular and mature park in Frankfield.\r\n\r\nThe property occupies a wonderful position within the park - large corner plot, quiet cul de sac position and huge amount of privacy not being overlooked. It offers tremendous potential to extend on further if required given the space to the side and rear of the property. It already offers well appointed accommodation and is superbly presented by its current owner. It has been re-decorated along with new flooring making it perfect for those looking for a turnkey home. This house is in impeccable condition being in walk-in condition ready for immediate occupation which is hugely beneficial in today's market. \r\n\r\nIt boasts a large rear garden that offers excellent privacy, enjoying lots of evening sun given its orientation stated above and also has the benefit of overlooking a large green area to the front.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none - conveniently situated close to all amenities & services in Frankfield & Douglas and there is easy access to regular bus routes daily. It enjoys easy access to South Link Road Network linking east to west via the Jack Lynch Tunnel and Cork Airport & Cork City Centre are a mere 5 minutes drive.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended to appreciate what this property offers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.49m x 1.84m \r\nWooden front door with glazed side panel, tile floor, spotlights, carpet stairway, understairs storage with fitted shelving and centre light. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.48m x 3.26m \r\nTile floor, fitted kitchen unit, spotlights, sliding door to rear garden, window blind.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.47m x 3.49m \r\nWooden floor, open fireplace with surround, spotlights.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, access to overhead attic, hot press unit with shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.34m x 2.91m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, built in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.43m x 0.77m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, shower unit with enclosure, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.48m x 2.9m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.52m x 2.41m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light, built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.02m x 1.81m \r\nTile floor, WC, WHB with tile splashback and overhead storage cabinet, fitted shelf, bath unit with overhead electric shower and enclosure. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 88.1 sq metres (947 sq ft) \r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows Doors\r\nQuiet cul de sac position \r\nLarge west facing rear garden\r\nReady for immediate occupation \r\nSpacious living and bedroom accommodation\r\nMature and popular residential location\r\nMinutes to all amenities & services in Frankfield & Douglas\r\nEasy access to South Link Road Network\r\nEasy access to a regular public bus service \r\nShort commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From the Kinsale road roundabout, take the Kinsale/Airport road and take an immediate left for Douglas/Frankfield. Continue on this road passing Hanley's Garden Centre on your right and continue to the traffic lights. Take an immediate right hand turn directly after the set of traffic lights into Curragh Woods.  Upon entering the estate, take your 1st left and continue on following the road and taking your 2nd turn to the left splitting the green. At the next junction, take another left and follow the road around taking the 3rd left and then finally the last turn left with No.149 situated right in the corner, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode: T12 ED8F"
      }
    ],
